part.text:
The `LPOS` command did indeed have its `FIRST` option renamed to `RANK`.

This change was established in commit `a5a3a7b` with the message: "LPOS: option FIRST renamed RANK."

The diff in that commit confirms the renaming:
```diff
-    test {LPOS FIRST (positive and negative rank) option} {
-        assert {[r LPOS mylist c FIRST 1] == 2}
...
+    test {LPOS RANK (positive and negative rank) option} {
+        assert {[r LPOS mylist c RANK 1] == 2}
```
